*.local

# Local Compose config — keep the template, ignore real env files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# AI harness tooling. Impeccable vendors ~3MB of skill files into .claude, and
# settings.local.json is per-developer by design. Install it per checkout with
# `npx impeccable install --providers=claude --scope=project` rather than
# committing it. Drop a negation here if a shared .claude/settings.json is ever
# wanted in the repo.
.claude/

# The same rule for everything Impeccable writes: working state (.impeccable/
# holds critique snapshots, hook config and a design-system sidecar) and the
# documents it generates. Both are regenerated per checkout; the reasoning that
# matters is in the source comments instead.
.impeccable/
DESIGN.md
PRODUCT.md
